{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43933","headline":"柳絮 · 张夫人","name":"柳絮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霭霭芳春朝，雪絮起青条。\n或值花同舞，不因风自飘。\n过尊浮绿醑，拂幌缀红绡。\n那用持愁翫，春怀不自聊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张夫人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}